[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2479980593","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99264#issuecomment-2479980593","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99264","id":2479980593,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6T0YAx","user":{"login":"colinator27","id":17358554,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzU4NTU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17358554?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/colinator27","html_url":"https://github.com/colinator27","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colinator27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colinator27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colinator27/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colinator27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colinator27/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colinator27/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colinator27/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colinator27/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colinator27/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-15T21:44:07Z","updated_at":"2024-11-15T21:44:07Z","body":"I did some further testing, and I have discovered a new bug introduced by this PR, specifically due to the changes from `float` to `double`. In some cases, like waiting for the end of a bar, interactive music can queue a clip to start at *exactly* the end of that clip. Normally, this is detected and wrapped around to 0. However, it seems that there are 32-bit floats used to calculate the lengths of OGGs and at least other types of streams like MP3, which cause their calculated stream length to be slightly higher. This causes errors, at least with OGG, where it fails to play and spams errors.\r\n\r\nSince this seems like an underlying issue with those streams, I'm going to undo the changes from `float` to `double` for this PR so as not to introduce any regressions, and properly address it in a future PR. It seems like a fix that needs to be made across each stream so that they calculate their lengths using 64-bit floats instead.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2479980593/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2480053672","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99264#issuecomment-2480053672","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99264","id":2480053672,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6T0p2o","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-15T22:31:38Z","updated_at":"2024-11-15T22:31:38Z","body":"Oops, tried to enable your workflow but that removed the draft status for some reason; that should be resolved now","author_a