 longer working correctly, at least with OGG. I have now restored that logic, and that behavior now works again. Silence is still added to the internal buffer for `AudioStreamPlaybackResampled`, as that fixes one of the audio pops.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2483702071/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]